<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  BigFix Fixlet Export

  Title    : Prevent client re-registration for Read Only Filesystem (_BESClient_Register_StopOnFlushError)
  ID       : 25123
  Author   : brolly33
  Domain   : BESC
  Imported : 2018-02-15T09:11:00
  Source   : bigfixm1_main @ BES-Root
-->
<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Fixlet>
    <Title>Prevent client re-registration for Read Only Filesystem (_BESClient_Register_StopOnFlushError)</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<TABLE style="WIDTH: 818px; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial" cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width=1023 border=1>
<TBODY>
<TR>
<TD style="WIDTH: 463px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 4.45pt; PADDING-TOP: 4.45pt; PADDING-LEFT: 6pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 6pt">
<P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12.25pt"><B>_BESClient_Register_StopOnFlushError</B><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: helvetica,sans-serif"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt"><A id=_BESClient_ActionManager_UIMissingHoldMode name=_BESClient_ActionManager_UIMissingHoldMode></A></SPAN></SPAN></STRONG></P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: helvetica,sans-serif"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt">To prevent </SPAN></SPAN>that duplicated computers are generated on the Console when the BESClient file system goes temporarily in read-only mode<SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: helvetica,sans-serif"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt">.</SPAN></SPAN></TD>
<TD style="WIDTH: 319px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 4.45pt; PADDING-TOP: 4.45pt; PADDING-LEFT: 6pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 6pt">
<UL>
<LI style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0in; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0in"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: helvetica,sans-serif"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt">Default Value: 0 (False)</SPAN></SPAN>
<LI style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0in; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0in"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: helvetica,sans-serif"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt">Setting Type: Boolean</SPAN></SPAN>
<LI style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0in; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0in"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: helvetica,sans-serif"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt">Values: 0-1</SPAN></SPAN></LI></UL></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE>
<P>New setting for 9.8.5 and further of BigFix. Helps avoides Duplicate Computers in the console&nbsp;in cases of Read Only Filesystem&nbsp;</P>
<P><A href="https://www.ibm.com/developerworks/community/wikis/home?lang=en#!/wiki/Tivoli%20Endpoint%20Manager/page/Configuration%20Settings/comment/d3afeeb4-3244-46d3-80a7-3ecb49f6de41">https://www.ibm.com/developerworks/community/wikis/home?lang=en#!/wiki/Tivoli%20Endpoint%20Manager/page/Configuration%20Settings/comment/d3afeeb4-3244-46d3-80a7-3ecb49f6de41</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>not exists setting &quot;_BESClient_Register_StopOnFlushError&quot; whose (value of it as string = &quot;1&quot;) of client</Relevance>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[version of client >= "9.5.8" as version]]></Relevance>
    <Category>Client Settings</Category>
    <Source>bigfix.me</Source>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2018-02-15</SourceReleaseDate>
    <MIMEField>
      <Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
      <Value>Thu, 15 Feb 2018 17:02:48 +0000</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <DefaultAction ID="Action1">
      <Description>
        <PreLink>Click </PreLink>
        <Link>here</Link>
        <PostLink> to deploy this action.</PostLink>
      </Description>
      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell">setting &quot;_BESClient_Register_StopOnFlushError&quot;=&quot;1&quot; on &quot;{parameter &quot;action issue date&quot; of action}&quot; for client</ActionScript>
    </DefaultAction>
  </Fixlet>
</BES>
